{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00016",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.92,
      "end_seconds": 5.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Doctor, we're ready in room two, I've already taken the observations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.45,
      "end_seconds": 10.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Great. Hello, come in and sit down. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.98,
      "end_seconds": 12.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "I've been feeling very thirsty."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.82,
      "end_seconds": 18.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "And when did that start? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.47,
      "end_seconds": 21.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "About... well, six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.84,
      "end_seconds": 27.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "And what do you do to cope with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.22,
      "end_seconds": 30.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Drinking water helps a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.7,
      "end_seconds": 32.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Have you been losing weight without trying?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.44,
      "end_seconds": 35.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Yes, since Monday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.57,
      "end_seconds": 40.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Have you been going to the toilet a lot, even at night?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.74,
      "end_seconds": 43.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Yes, for two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.99,
      "end_seconds": 47.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Is the room warm enough for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.08,
      "end_seconds": 49.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "It's perfect, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.54,
      "end_seconds": 54.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any fever, breathlessness or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.97,
      "end_seconds": 59.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "I haven't had fever, breathlessness or vomiting, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.48,
      "end_seconds": 63.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Any abdominal pain or blurred vision at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.32,
      "end_seconds": 69.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "I haven't had abdominal pain or blurred vision, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.56,
      "end_seconds": 74.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.95,
      "end_seconds": 81.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "I hadn't even noticed, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 82.4,
      "end_seconds": 92.42,
      "duration_seconds": 10.02,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Height 166 centimetres, weight 59 kilos, BMI works out to 21.4, temperature 36.6, blood pressure 114 over 81, pulse 66."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.0,
      "end_seconds": 100.38,
      "duration_seconds": 6.38,
      "text": "Okay, noted. Right, is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.85,
      "end_seconds": 110.12,
      "duration_seconds": 9.27,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.2,
      "end_seconds": 118.51,
      "duration_seconds": 7.31,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.85,
      "end_seconds": 124.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "I have asthma. I have heart failure, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.21,
      "end_seconds": 126.91,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.67,
      "end_seconds": 131.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.63,
      "end_seconds": 132.42,
      "duration_seconds": 0.79,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.12,
      "end_seconds": 149.04,
      "duration_seconds": 7.92,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.39,
      "end_seconds": 153.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Shellfish. I come out in... well, hives."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.51,
      "end_seconds": 159.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Alright, what about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.13,
      "end_seconds": 162.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "My father had a heart attack."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.91,
      "end_seconds": 166.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.25,
      "end_seconds": 168.09,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.07,
      "end_seconds": 186.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.65,
      "end_seconds": 188.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "I've never smoked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.92,
      "end_seconds": 198.19,
      "duration_seconds": 6.27,
      "text": "Alright, are you on any tablets or medication? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.54,
      "end_seconds": 202.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "I'm on Seretide inhaler, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.66,
      "end_seconds": 203.36,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Mm-hm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.38,
      "end_seconds": 218.73,
      "duration_seconds": 14.35,
      "text": "Spironolactone, 25 milligrams, once a day. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.2,
      "end_seconds": 221.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "I see. Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.52,
      "end_seconds": 224.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "No, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.95,
      "end_seconds": 228.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.11,
      "end_seconds": 229.93,
      "duration_seconds": 0.82,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.76,
      "end_seconds": 243.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Okay, here we go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.33,
      "end_seconds": 249.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.43,
      "end_seconds": 252.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Bear with me a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.54,
      "end_seconds": 272.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "You're a little dry, but alert, and your breathing is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.71,
      "end_seconds": 276.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Right, stay still while I have a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.41,
      "end_seconds": 287.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft and non-tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.01,
      "end_seconds": 294.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Right, that's fine, you can get dressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.28,
      "end_seconds": 297.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Let me just write this down properly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.68,
      "end_seconds": 335.82,
      "duration_seconds": 21.14,
      "text": "Okay, continuing. So, based on the history and the examination, this looks most like possible new-onset diabetes. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been feeling very thirsty for six months, and no vomiting or abdominal pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.42,
      "end_seconds": 337.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.24,
      "end_seconds": 341.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 342.28,
      "end_seconds": 353.44,
      "duration_seconds": 11.16,
      "text": "Yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.16,
      "end_seconds": 361.17,
      "duration_seconds": 7.01,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange an HbA1c for possible diabetes. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 362.01,
      "end_seconds": 363.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 364.04,
      "end_seconds": 389.72,
      "duration_seconds": 25.68,
      "text": "Until we have the results, avoid sugary drinks and fruit juices, and keep drinking plain water. Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. Please don't sit on it if you start vomiting or become drowsy. That's the point to get seen urgently. Let's review you tomorrow with the results."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 390.49,
      "end_seconds": 394.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 395.08,
      "end_seconds": 399.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Just to confirm, what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 400.22,
      "end_seconds": 404.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "So, I come back tomorrow with the results. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 405.48,
      "end_seconds": 407.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Good. Look after yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 408.84,
      "end_seconds": 411.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "That's all, thank you for your time."
    }
  ]
}